# Gemini API Key Configuration
# You can get a free key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Note: Edu-Path allows dynamic input and storage of the API Key directly in the browser's localStorage.
# If you prefer to hardcode it for local development, you can rename this file to .env.local and set it here.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
